Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.97,0:00:05.84,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,356)\fade(255,0,255,0,1240,3560,4880)}Episode 14
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.96,0:00:05.84,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,536)\fade(255,0,255,0,1240,3560,4880)}Discussing Heroes over Wine
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.12,0:00:12.35,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,In the third year of the Jian'an era, 198 CE,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.35,0:00:14.90,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Cao Cao, with the help of Liu Bei,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.90,0:00:18.33,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,conquered Xu Province and Xiapi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.33,0:00:21.98,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,At White Gate Tower, he Lü Bu hanged
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.98,0:00:25.26,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,and received the surrender of the great Zhang Liao.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.26,0:00:28.71,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,He thus wiped out the trouble in his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.01,0:00:34.52,Default,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,Ministers who have achievements shall be rewarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.13,0:00:39.34,Default,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,The nation being maintained through your efforts,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.34,0:00:41.60,Default,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,I can be at rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.60,0:00:43.74,Default,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,Generals and warriors of merit,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.74,0:00:46.72,Default,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,please request Minister Cao for your rewards.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.28,0:00:49.76,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(301.714,464)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2220,2480)}Cáo Cāo\NStyled: Mèngdé
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.86,0:00:50.16,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,As you command.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.13,0:00:52.54,Default,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,Beloved liegeman,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.54,0:00:55.64,Default,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,you memorialized yesterday about Liu Bei's exploits.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.64,0:00:58.04,Default,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,Why not call him to an audience with Us?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.31,0:01:00.23,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,As you command.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.15,0:01:04.58,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Liu Bei is called for an audience!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.00,0:01:13.16,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(372.571,464)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2760,3160)}Liú Bèi\NStyled: Xuándé
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.84,0:01:23.76,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,My humblest respects, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.52,0:01:28.73,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Long live! Long, long live!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.96,0:01:29.04,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(992,365.714)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2760,3160)}Emperor\N Xiàn of Hàn
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.84,0:01:31.47,Default,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,You may rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.03,0:01:34.92,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Thank you, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.67,0:01:37.42,Default,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,You do look majestic.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.42,0:01:39.08,Default,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,Who are your ancestors?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.17,0:01:42.72,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I am a descendant of Prince Jing of Zhongshan,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.72,0:01:44.75,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,and a distant descendant of Emperor Jing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.75,0:01:46.38,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I am the grandson of Liu Xiong
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.38,0:01:47.58,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,and the son of Liu Hong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.68,0:01:50.86,Default,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,Inspect the imperial clan genealogy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.86,0:01:51.20,Default,Clan Minister,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.73,0:01:58.64,Default,Clan Minister,0,0,0,,Your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.64,0:01:59.45,Default,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,Read it out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.45,0:01:59.97,Default,Clan Minister,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.31,0:02:09.80,Default,Clan Minister,0,0,0,,Emperor Jing had fourteen sons.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.16,0:02:14.16,Default,Clan Minister,0,0,0,,The seventh was Prince Jing of Zhongshan, Liu Sheng.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.16,0:02:17.72,Default,Clan Minister,0,0,0,,He begat the District Marquis of Lucheng, Liu Ang,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.62,0:02:20.25,Default,Clan Minister,0,0,0,,who begat the Marquis of Zhang, Liu Lu,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.00,0:02:23.95,Default,Clan Minister,0,0,0,,who begat the Marquis of Yishui, Liu Lian,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.95,0:02:26.91,Default,Clan Minister,0,0,0,,who begat the Marquis of Qinyang, Liu Ying,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.91,0:02:29.39,Default,Clan Minister,0,0,0,,who begat the Marquis of Anguo, Liu Jian,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.39,0:02:31.90,Default,Clan Minister,0,0,0,,who begat the Marquis of Guangling, Liu Ai,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.90,0:02:34.49,Default,Clan Minister,0,0,0,,who begat the Marquis of Jiaoshui, Liu Xian,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.49,0:02:36.96,Default,Clan Minister,0,0,0,,who begat the Marquis of Zuyi, Liu Shu,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.97,0:02:39.39,Default,Clan Minister,0,0,0,,who begat the Marquis of Qiyang, Liu Yi,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.39,0:02:41.72,Default,Clan Minister,0,0,0,,who begat the Marquis of Yuanze, Liu Bi,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.72,0:02:43.87,Default,Clan Minister,0,0,0,,who begat the Marquis of Yingchuan, Liu Da,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.87,0:02:46.26,Default,Clan Minister,0,0,0,,who begat the Marquis of Banling, Liu Buyi,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.26,0:02:48.60,Default,Clan Minister,0,0,0,,who begat the Marquis of Jichuan, Liu Hui,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.60,0:02:51.61,Default,Clan Minister,0,0,0,,who begat the Prefect of Fan, Liu Xiong,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.61,0:02:53.34,Default,Clan Minister,0,0,0,,who begat Liu Hong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.34,0:02:54.53,Default,Clan Minister,0,0,0,,Liu Hong held no rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.53,0:02:57.52,Default,Clan Minister,0,0,0,,Liu Bei is the son of Liu Hong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.45,0:03:18.35,Thinking,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,Cao Cao has absolute power. Not one state matter is of Our doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.11,0:03:22.51,Thinking,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,Now with this hero, there will finally be salvation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.64,0:03:43.06,Default,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,Please rise, Imperial Uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.47,0:03:47.54,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Thank you, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.21,0:03:54.12,Default,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,Follow Us to the main hall to pay our respects, as Our relative.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.72,0:04:20.64,Default,Herald,0,0,0,,Court is dismissed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.54,0:04:29.01,Default,Xun You,0,0,0,,Chancellor, the Emperor acknowledges \NLiu Bei as the Imperial Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.24,0:04:27.36,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(993.143,465.143)\fade(255,0,255,0,340,1860,2120)}Xún Yōu\NStyled: Gōngdá
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.01,0:04:31.24,Default,Xun You,0,0,0,,This may be problematic to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.77,0:04:36.01,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Liu Bei may act as the Imperial Uncle,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.01,0:04:38.94,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,yet I am the one issuing the decrees in the Emperor's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.94,0:04:40.53,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,How could he not obey them?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.14,0:04:46.37,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Besides, if I keep Liu Bei here in Xudu (Xuchang),
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.37,0:04:50.31,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,his bond with the Emperor only places him deeper within my grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.11,0:04:55.91,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Why should I fear him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.61,0:05:00.82,Default,Xun You,0,0,0,,Chancellor, your might and prestige increases by the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.82,0:05:03.80,Default,Xun You,0,0,0,,Why not conduct yourself alike to a hegemon?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.08,0:05:17.16,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Before that, let us raise a toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.14,0:05:18.67,Default,Xun You,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.08,0:05:27.52,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,The imperial family has many supporters and must not be underestimated.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.28,0:05:39.12,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I already asked the Emperor \Nto go hunting tommorow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.02,0:05:41.59,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,We shall see how they act.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.45,0:05:49.09,Default,Servant,0,0,0,,Chancellor! Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.93,0:05:54.88,Default,Servant,0,0,0,,Chancellor, on your orders,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.88,0:05:59.43,Default,Servant,0,0,0,,I have prepared a house for Liu Bei near your mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.40,0:06:02.01,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.74,0:06:06.80,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Send people to spy on Liu Bei at all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.08,0:06:09.32,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Report back when possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.32,0:06:10.12,Default,Servant,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.00,0:06:18.50,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.35,0:06:26.94,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Brothers, you cannot make too much noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.74,0:06:33.34,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,This is our courtyard. What's it to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.56,0:06:38.77,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Brother, why are you neglecting your duties for the nation?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.24,0:06:39.12,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(281.143,461.7147)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2580,2880)}Zhāng Fēi\NStyled: Yìdé
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.77,0:06:40.96,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,You only grow vegetables everyday!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.16,0:06:48.37,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,The Son of Heaven called me Imperial Uncle,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.37,0:06:51.16,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,so everyone is keeping an eye on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.16,0:06:54.95,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,We must be cautious in our manners and words.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.95,0:06:58.61,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,This is so that others cannot \Nsuspect us of impudence.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.61,0:07:01.96,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Living next to the Chancellor, \Nwe must be all the more vigilant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.88,0:07:08.37,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Brother is paranoid!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.07,0:07:11.01,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,We haven't caused any trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.01,0:07:13.32,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Why do they care about whatever we do or say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.26,0:07:17.70,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Third Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.78,0:07:20.83,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,It is hard for Elder Brother to speak clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.36,0:07:24.72,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(300.571,462.857)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2100,2360)}Guān Yǔ\NStyled: Yúncháng
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.24,0:07:24.12,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,We must be careful, lest he gets in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.50,0:08:20.03,Default,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The realm is not at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.75,0:08:23.52,Default,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Hunting seems inappropriate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.54,0:08:26.01,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Your Majesty is mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.36,0:08:31.92,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12)}Sovereigns of old patrolled in autumn, and hunted in winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.92,0:08:36.97,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12}To leave the palace every season \Nwould show imperial magnanimity.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.22,0:08:44.24,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Whatever the turmoil, Your Majesty \Nmust show your might and authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.89,0:08:46.50,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}How is this inappropriate?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.76,0:09:13.76,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Your Majesty. Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.94,0:09:18.80,Default,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,Go, call the Imperial Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.46,0:09:21.31,Default,Servant,0,0,0,,The Imperial Uncle is called!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.24,0:09:41.04,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I offer my respects, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.26,0:09:56.00,Default,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,I wish to see you hunt, Imperial Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.58,0:09:58.14,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,As you command.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.50,0:10:20.42,Default,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,Nice! Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.42,0:10:21.81,Default,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,Good shot, Imperial Uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.81,0:10:23.67,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, you overpraise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.81,0:10:31.18,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,May Your Majesty hunt!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.04,0:11:14.44,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(984,486.857)}Dǒng Chéng
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.72,0:11:42.44,Default,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,Sir, will you not shoot?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.68,0:12:36.45,Default,Servant,0,0,0,,The Chancellor has hit the target!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.01,0:12:43.69,Default,Servant,0,0,0,,The Chancellor has hit the target!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.69,0:12:50.81,Default,General,0,0,0,,The Emperor has hit the target!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.81,0:13:03.26,Default,General,0,0,0,,It's the Son of Heaven's golden arrow! He's hit the target!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.26,0:13:08.68,Default,All,0,0,0,,Long live the Emperor! Long live!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.67,0:13:36.45,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Sire, such a divine shot is seldom in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.52,0:13:40.54,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,That was a blessing from the Emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.22,0:13:46.54,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,A blessing from the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.31,0:13:51.19,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,If I did not have his bow and his arrows,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.82,0:13:54.04,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,how could I have made such a shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.69,0:14:43.54,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Elder Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.58,0:14:52.54,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Brother, that bastard Cao Cao humiliated his Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.54,0:14:55.78,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,I would have rid the land of a traitor had I killed him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.76,0:15:00.41,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Why did you stop me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.26,0:15:13.98,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Cao Cao was just inches apart from the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.03,0:15:17.20,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,His men were standing guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.17,0:15:22.99,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Second Brother, if you acted in a fit of rage, the Son of Heaven could have been hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.11,0:15:26.69,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,The blame would have fallen on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.68,0:15:30.17,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,You have to let a rat go lest you break the wares.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.58,0:15:36.71,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,If we don't kill this bastard today, we'll face disaster later!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.73,0:15:53.30,Default,Empress Fu,0,0,0,,All of the court ministers received imperial grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.82,0:15:57.53,Default,Empress Fu,0,0,0,,Yet in this crisis, not one of them comes to our aid!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.93,0:15:58.76,Default,Fu Wan,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.98,0:16:01.70,Default,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.80,0:16:04.88,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(329.143,470.857)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1780,2080)}Fú Wán
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.40,0:16:08.14,Default,Fu Wan,0,0,0,,The General of Chariots and Cavalry, \NState Uncle Dong Cheng.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.74,0:16:09.86,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: State Uncle（国舅）is either the maternal uncle of the Emperor, or Emperor's brother-in-law
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.16,0:16:12.91,Default,Empress Fu,0,0,0,,Summon him now, there are urgent matters to discuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.33,0:16:15.04,Default,Fu Wan,0,0,0,,We cannot act recklessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.58,0:16:18.05,Default,Fu Wan,0,0,0,,In that case, what do you suggest we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.97,0:16:26.82,Default,Fu Wan,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.54,0:16:32.94,Default,Fu Wan,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Your Majesty may use your brocade robe and jade belt to hide an edict.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.94,0:16:36.88,Default,Fu Wan,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Later, summon Dong Cheng and gift them to him, and he will read the edict upon his return.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.88,0:16:39.91,Default,Fu Wan,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}This will express your desire to get rid of the rebel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.58,0:16:43.12,Default,Fu Wan,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Not even the gods or spirits will know of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.59,0:17:08.67,Default,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Worthy subject, wear this robe and fasten this jade belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.27,0:17:12.48,Default,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}You can thus be by Our side always.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.94,0:17:21.81,Default,Dong Cheng,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.30,0:17:35.66,Default,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,Our liegeman, you may examine it with care when you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.66,0:17:39.24,Default,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,Do not reject Our good will.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.31,0:17:56.48,Default,Servant,0,0,0,,Here comes the Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.54,0:18:14.24,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,How is Liu Bei doing these days?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.04,0:18:17.12,Default,Servant,0,0,0,,I asked his servants.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.15,0:18:20.97,Default,Servant,0,0,0,,They say he reads in his chamber, or tasting tea in the halls.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.97,0:18:26.58,Default,Servant,0,0,0,,After the hunt, he started to grow vegetables. He tends the orchard restlessly every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.68,0:18:28.92,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Vegetables?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.27,0:18:38.67,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Quite an idle life. Perhaps because he wants to hide from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.56,0:18:47.00,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,State Uncle, why are you hiding from me as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.72,0:18:57.52,Default,Dong Cheng,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.72,0:19:03.66,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,State Uncle, you entered the palace quite early.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.07,0:19:05.44,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.32,0:19:10.58,Default,Dong Cheng,0,0,0,,His Majesty summoned me to give me a brocade robe and a belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.09,0:19:13.90,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Today of all days?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.39,0:19:18.30,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Why the generosity from His Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.68,0:19:22.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,His Majesty recalled when I rescued him in the Western Capital (Cháng'ān).
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.02,0:19:25.35,Default,Dong Cheng,0,0,0,,He summoned me to discuss\N the past and gave me this present.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.71,0:19:41.81,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Let me see the belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.67,0:19:49.80,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Seize it from him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.47,0:20:09.73,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,What an exquisite jade belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.38,0:20:32.12,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,How does it look on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.12,0:20:33.36,Default,Servant,0,0,0,,It fits you perfectly!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.34,0:20:41.87,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,In that case, will you gift me this robe and belt, Imperial Uncle?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.26,0:20:48.05,Default,Dong Cheng,0,0,0,,I would not give away the sovereign's gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.56,0:20:54.78,Default,Dong Cheng,0,0,0,,If you like it, Chancellor, I can present another robe for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.94,0:21:03.48,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,State Uncle, does this robe hide any plots?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.51,0:21:12.93,Default,Dong Cheng,0,0,0,,Chancellor, if you insist, you may have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.17,0:21:16.81,Default,Dong Cheng,0,0,0,,Why the accusation of a hidden plot?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.34,0:21:19.14,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,State Uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.87,0:21:25.33,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,How could I keep a gift from the Son of Heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.13,0:21:42.78,Thinking,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,Our liegeman, you may examine it with care when you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.04,0:21:45.95,Thinking,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,Do not reject Our good will.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.72,0:23:20.41,Default,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"It is said amongst people's relations, \Nthat of a father and his son comes first."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.41,0:23:24.26,Default,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,{\bord12\}"Among hierarchy, those between lord and subject take priority."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.26,0:23:27.12,Default,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"The traitor Cao Cao abuses power."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.12,0:23:30.75,Default,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"He oppresses his monarch and the family ties, and amasses military strength."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.75,0:23:33.22,Default,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"He undermines the imperium."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.22,0:23:37.04,Default,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"Law of rewards and punishments no longer depend on Us."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.68,0:23:43.48,Default,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"At all times, We have troubled thoughts of the world at the brink of peril."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.95,0:23:49.66,Default,Liu Xie,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"You are a grand minister of \Nthe nation and a dearest relative of Ours."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.54,0:23:54.78,Default,Dong Cheng,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"Remember the struggle met by our First Emperor Gaozu."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.78,0:23:59.25,Default,Dong Cheng,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"Gather loyal and righteous heroes \Nto purge villains."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.25,0:24:02.45,Default,Dong Cheng,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"To revive the imperium, and honour the spirit of the nation and our ancestors."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.45,0:24:07.17,Default,Dong Cheng,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"We entrust you this edict, written with the blood of Our finger."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.17,0:24:13.56,Default,Dong Cheng,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"Consider this carefully, \Ndo not forsake Our wishes."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.37,0:24:19.81,Default,Wang Zifu,0,0,0,,The impudence!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.05,0:24:27.96,Default,Dong Cheng,0,0,0,,Zifu!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.59,0:24:37.08,Default,Wang Zifu,0,0,0,,If you seek to kill Lord Cao, then I must warn him!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.88,0:24:40.08,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(314.286,325.714)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1850,2200)}Wáng Zǐfú
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.12,0:24:38.66,Default,Dong Cheng,0,0,0,,Zifu!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.22,0:24:46.76,Default,Dong Cheng,0,0,0,,If that's what you want... My life may worth little, but the Han dynasty will suffer!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.91,0:24:57.66,Default,Wang Zifu,0,0,0,,Lord Dong.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.71,0:25:04.97,Default,Wang Zifu,0,0,0,,My family has been favored by the House of Han for ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.97,0:25:06.90,Default,Wang Zifu,0,0,0,,How could I lack a loyal heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.31,0:25:14.60,Default,Wang Zifu,0,0,0,,I will aid you in purging the traitors to the state!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.86,0:25:18.68,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,You have come so late, State Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.10,0:25:20.36,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,You must have a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.47,0:25:25.86,Default,Dong Cheng,0,0,0,,To visit in plain daylight would make Cao Cao suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.91,0:25:28.80,Default,Dong Cheng,0,0,0,,Therefore, I came late at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.83,0:25:32.49,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Fetch wine for our guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.56,0:25:32.88,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.58,0:25:38.82,Default,Dong Cheng,0,0,0,,During the hunt that day,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.82,0:25:40.76,Default,Dong Cheng,0,0,0,,Yunchang wanted to kill Cao Cao.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.76,0:25:44.22,Default,Dong Cheng,0,0,0,,You shook your head to dissuade him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.72,0:25:45.68,Default,Dong Cheng,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.39,0:25:47.63,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,How did you know, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.00,0:25:50.74,Default,Dong Cheng,0,0,0,,Nobody else knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.74,0:25:52.48,Default,Dong Cheng,0,0,0,,Only I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.17,0:26:02.30,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,My brother was enraged by the sight of Cao Cao humiliating our sovereign
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.38,0:26:10.01,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,State Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.82,0:26:23.52,Default,Dong Cheng,0,0,0,,If every minister was like you, Yunchang, \Nwho would worry about peace in the Empire?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.20,0:26:30.04,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,How is Chancellor Cao's regime not peaceful?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.78,0:26:37.27,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,State Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.35,0:26:42.52,Default,Dong Cheng,0,0,0,,Sir, you are the Imperial Uncle of the Han.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.52,0:26:44.98,Default,Dong Cheng,0,0,0,,Therefore, I was honest with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.30,0:26:47.06,Default,Dong Cheng,0,0,0,,Why are you lying?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.06,0:26:48.12,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,State Uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.33,0:26:52.82,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I was just testing in case you were lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.83,0:26:55.32,Default,Dong Cheng,0,0,0,,How could I lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.24,0:26:58.68,Default,Dong Cheng,0,0,0,,General, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.10,0:27:26.08,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Second Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.88,0:27:28.80,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Third Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.36,0:27:31.30,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.30,0:27:33.97,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,To think that our Great Han Empire...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.01,0:27:39.24,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,To think that our Emperor, who stands above all...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.37,0:27:51.95,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,... has to resort to an edict written in blood to his officials!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.04,0:27:59.79,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Elder Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.28,0:28:02.16,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Elder Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.74,0:28:04.50,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Elder Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.83,0:28:07.46,Default,Dong Cheng,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.36,0:28:19.03,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,"General of Chariots and Cavalry, Dong Cheng; Industry Gentleman, Wang Zifu;"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.03,0:28:22.09,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,"Chang River Commandant Zhong Ji; \NGentleman Consultant Wu Shuo;"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.09,0:28:26.03,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,"General of Clear Loyalty, Wu Zilan; \Nand the Administrator of Xiliang, Ma Teng."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.14,0:28:38.22,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,With this imperial order to expel the rebels, I will do my utmost!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.76,0:28:42.06,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Second Brother, bring me a brush.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.06,0:28:42.56,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.12,0:29:41.50,Default,Xu Chu,0,0,0,,The Chancellor has orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.50,0:29:42.93,Default,Xu Chu,0,0,0,,You must go now!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.33,0:29:51.76,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,What is the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.76,0:29:53.92,Default,Xu Chu,0,0,0,,I don't know. He only told me to call you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.06,0:29:58.11,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Let me pull the bucket from the well first.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.23,0:30:29.26,Default,Servant,0,0,0,,Lord Liu has arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.64,0:30:37.54,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,You've been doing great work at your house!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.87,0:30:44.50,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Growing your own little garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.50,0:30:48.80,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,It must not be easy to have time for yourself, Xuande.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.20,0:30:57.64,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Such things are but hobbies. Chancellor, why have you summoned me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.65,0:31:00.42,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Xuande.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.80,0:31:06.26,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I saw green plums on the trees and felt nostalgic.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.06,0:31:11.26,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,When I was campaigning against Zhang Xiu, \Nthere was no water on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.26,0:31:14.05,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,The troops were thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.05,0:31:16.02,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I thought of something brilliant!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.04,0:31:26.20,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: This is the origin of the Chinese idiom "望梅止渴", \Nfrom {\i1}A New Account of the Tales of the World.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.02,0:31:18.93,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I pointed ahead and said \Nwe were nearing a plum forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.93,0:31:23.59,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Hearing that, their mouths started to water, thus quenching their thirst!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.45,0:31:27.86,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Seeing a plum tree today, I can't help but to behold it in admiration.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.34,0:31:30.22,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,And how! For it is ripe.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.22,0:31:32.40,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I invited you as a drinking partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.16,0:31:42.76,Default,Servant,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.31,0:31:45.08,Default,Servant,0,0,0,,Look, a dragon hangs in the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.24,0:32:02.72,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12)}The dragon hanging from the heavens, as if tossing and curling,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.72,0:32:04.82,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}turning over oceans and rivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.90,0:32:08.48,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,A truly admirable sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.12,0:32:15.84,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Sir, do you understand the many forms of dragons?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.84,0:32:18.20,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I do not know, please explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.89,0:32:27.24,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Dragons can be large or small. They can soar or hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.24,0:32:29.63,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The large ones birth clouds and breath mist.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.63,0:32:32.80,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The small ones conceal themselves from sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.80,0:32:35.69,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Those that fly soar across creation,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.69,0:32:39.48,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}those that hide dwell within great waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.79,0:32:44.59,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Here, deep within spring, is when dragons form,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.59,0:32:49.49,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}like men with the will to conquer the Four Seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.44,0:32:56.60,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The large ones births clouds and breathes mist...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.38,0:33:02.13,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The small ones conceal themselves from sight...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.37,0:33:07.28,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Those that fly soar across creation,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.24,0:33:12.08,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Those that hide dwell within great waves...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.00,0:33:20.35,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Among all creatures, the dragon can be compared to the heroes in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.00,0:33:24.22,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Xuande, since you have ventured across the land,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.22,0:33:26.02,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I assume you know such heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.00,0:33:29.54,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I ask of you to inform me who they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.20,0:33:41.40,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}How could I recognize heroes with just my eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.94,0:33:43.57,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Enough with the modesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.13,0:33:48.45,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Due to your favor, I serve within the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.45,0:33:51.52,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12}As for the heroes of the world, I regretfully do not know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.00,0:33:56.94,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Even if you forgot their faces, you know of their reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.24,0:34:04.64,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Is Yuan Shu of Huainan,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.64,0:34:07.14,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}with his abundant supplies and troops, a hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.82,0:34:11.94,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}He is a withering skeleton in a grave!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.94,0:34:13.64,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}His defeat by me is inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.98,0:34:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\}Yuan Shao of Hebei, scion of four generations of Excellencies.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.08,0:34:24.12,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}He awaits in Ji Province alike to a tiger,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.12,0:34:27.81,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12}With many capable men under his command, is he a hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.32,0:34:33.28,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Yuan Shao appears fierce, but has no guts!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.66,0:34:35.48,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}He schemes, but lacks decisiveness!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.48,0:34:39.16,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Conservative, despite his ambitions. \NHe forgets himself over tiny gains.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.16,0:34:41.25,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}He is no hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.00,0:34:53.96,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Liu Jingsheng, famed as one of the Eight Talents across the Nine Provinces, can he be a hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.64,0:34:57.77,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Liu Biao has nothing behind his reputation. He is no hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.36,0:35:06.04,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}There's a man of valour who rules over Jiangdong;
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.04,0:35:08.74,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}surely Sun Bofu is a hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.74,0:35:11.44,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Sun Ce rides on his father's name, he is no hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.44,0:35:13.63,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}What of Liu Jiyu of Yi Province, is he a hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.32,0:35:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12)}Liú Zhāng may be of the imperial family, but he's nothing more than a watchdog.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.80,0:35:20.20,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}How can he be a hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.25,0:35:21.85,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.82,0:35:26.92,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}How about Zhang Xiu, Zhang Lu, and Han Sui?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.95,0:35:31.44,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12)}All but lesser men, \Nare they truly worth mentioning?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.92,0:35:39.87,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Other than them, I know no one else.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.15,0:35:57.46,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Heroes...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.63,0:36:02.97,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Heroes harbor grand ideals in their hearts, and methods to fulfill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.86,0:36:07.32,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Schemes within schemes all-embracing,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.71,0:36:11.72,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}and the will to devour the very earth at their mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.47,0:36:16.90,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Who can be considered such?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.82,0:36:23.00,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Now, of the heroes of the world under heaven...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.52,0:36:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}... There is only {\i1}you{\i0} and {\i1}I!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.87,0:37:16.96,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Such tremendous thunder!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.98,0:37:20.76,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}How can a grown man be afraid of thunder?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.60,0:37:25.60,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: "The Sage One" refers to Confucius.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.52,0:37:25.44,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The Sage One once said that one must falter before sudden thunder.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.44,0:37:26.60,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}How can I not be afraid?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.30,0:37:44.18,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,If we remain in the Xudu,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.18,0:37:46.19,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Cao Cao will harm us sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.57,0:37:51.64,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,It is said that Yuan Shu has rebelled in Huainan,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.64,0:37:55.60,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,and he wants to forfeit the \Nimperial seal and title to Yuan Shao.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.60,0:37:59.53,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,If Yuan Shu is to join Yuan Shao, he must pass through Xu Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.33,0:38:04.29,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,We must seize this chance and ask to halt Yuan Shu.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.29,0:38:09.78,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,By claiming to block the two Yuans from merging, \Nwe can hide our plan for independence.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.20,0:38:12.34,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Elder Brother's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.34,0:38:15.54,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,If we ask for troops to block Yuan Shu,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.54,0:38:17.88,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,this too will rid Cao Cao of a great threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.88,0:38:19.97,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,He will have no reason to decline.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.08,0:38:23.22,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.01,0:38:27.01,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I will memorialize the throne to ask for permission to campaign.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.82,0:38:33.68,Default,Guo Jia,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.88,0:38:36.08,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(286.857,453.714)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1820,2200)}Guō Jiā\NStyled: Fèngxiào
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.18,0:38:37.79,Default,Guo Jia,0,0,0,,I know Chancellor must have \Na greater reason for not killing Liu Bei.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.88,0:38:41.00,Default,Guo Jia,0,0,0,,Still, you cannot let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.66,0:38:45.76,Default,Guo Jia,0,0,0,,Releasing a foe one day will lead to trouble for generations!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.76,0:38:47.12,Default,Guo Jia,0,0,0,,Chancellor, I hope you reconsider-
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.12,0:38:49.81,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I sent Zhu Ling and Lu Zhao to accompany Liu Bei.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.81,0:38:51.94,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,They may leave as his deputy officers,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.94,0:38:53.78,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,but they are there to watch over him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.78,0:38:55.06,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I know Liu Bei could not...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.75,0:39:03.72,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Attendants.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.72,0:39:04.16,Thinking,Servant,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.04,0:39:06.30,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Summon Xu Chu now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.30,0:39:06.73,Thinking,Servant,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.73,0:39:13.41,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,General, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.13,0:39:16.05,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,The Chancellor's men have arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.98,0:39:34.32,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,General Xu Chu, why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.00,0:39:37.00,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(945.143,445.714)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1500,2000)}Xǔ Chǔ\NStyled: Zhòngkāng
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.96,0:39:37.58,Default,Xu Chu,0,0,0,,The Chancellor ordered me to escort you back!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.58,0:39:38.76,Default,Xu Chu,0,0,0,,That is all to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.46,0:39:43.12,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Once the general is on the field, he does not have to accept the Sovereign's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.12,0:39:47.32,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,With the Chancellor's consent, \NI took my leave before the Emperor. That is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.81,0:39:49.28,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,You should leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.85,0:39:59.05,Default,Xu Chu,0,0,0,,Very well, I will return to the Chancellor and pass your message.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.46,0:40:00.01,Default,Xu Chu,0,0,0,,Farewell!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.69,0:40:10.69,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Zhu Ling and Lu Zhao!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.69,0:40:11.25,Default,Zhu Ling & Lu Zhao,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.25,0:40:14.65,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Order the infantry and cavalry \Nto march faster without pause!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.65,0:40:15.12,Default,Zhu Ling & Lu Zhao,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.59,0:40:22.96,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Brother, why are you in such a hurry to campaign?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.89,0:40:26.81,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I am like a bird in a cage, or like a fish in a net.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.34,0:40:31.10,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,If I hurry, I will be like a bird soaring, or a fish swimming!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.10,0:40:32.45,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I would be free forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.23,0:40:40.05,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Elder Brother!

